22 15.42 11.57 15.65C10.93 15.88 10.23 16 9.5 16ZM9.5 14C10.75 14 11.81 13.56 12.69 12.69C13.56 11.81 14 10.75 14 9.5C14 8.25 13.56 7.19 12.69 6.31C11.81 5.44 10.75 5 9.5 5C8.25 5 7.19 5.44 6.31 6.31C5.44 7.19 5 8.25 5 9.5C5 10.75 5.44 11.81 6.31 12.69C7.19 13.56 8.25 14 9.5 14Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div></div></button></div><!----></div></div></div></div></div><div class="faqs__inner" data-v-b67004cf><section class="faqs__wrapper" data-v-b67004cf><div class="faqs__content" data-v-b67004cf><div class="faqs__inner-slices" data-v-b67004cf><div data-v-b67004cf><!--[--><section id="what-time-will-the-courier-collect-my-parcel?" class="section-wrapper rich-text" index="0" data-v-92714c58 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><h1><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->What time will the courier collect my parcel?<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h1><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->You can expect your parcel to be <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/our-services/courier-service" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->collected<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> between 8am to 8pm Monday to Friday, and between 8am to 6pm on Saturdays. We don’t collect parcels on Sundays or on bank holidays. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Don’t forget, you can also use any one of our ParcelShops to drop off your parcel at a time to suit you. There are 9,000+ <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/find-a-parcelshop" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->ParcelShops across the UK<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, and many of them are open early ‘til late, 7 days a week. <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/find-a-parcelshop" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Find your nearest ParcelShop<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->. Most of our ParcelShops have Print In ParcelShop devices – not only can you <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/parcelshops/print-in-parcelshop" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->print your parcel label in the shop<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> (if you&#39;ve already booked online or with the Evri app), you can use the device to book and pay too. You just need to bring your parcel with you. We have <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/parcelshops/lockers" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Lockers<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> across the UK, most available 24/7, outside local shops and supermarkets.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section><!--]--></div></div></div><div class="faqs-right-coumn" data-v-b67004cf><!----></div></section><div class="faqs-accordion__container" data-v-b67004cf data-v-538ce356><section class="faqs-accordion" data-v-538ce356><!--[--><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="faq-links-accordion-row-0" data-v-538ce356 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-faq-links-0" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-faq-links-0" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="faq-links-accordion-row-0-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="faq-links-accordion-row-0-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Account</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24"